# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version if using pyenv
#   but it is often preferred to keep it local.
#.python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#1181, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in git.
#   However, if you want to ignore it, uncomment the next line:
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Poetry objects to ignoring poetry.lock, but some users prefer it.
#poetry.lock

